# AI Personality Enhancement Guidelines

## System Instruction Framework
Current location: [src/core/app/GdmLiveAudio.tsx](mdc:src/core/app/GdmLiveAudio.tsx) (systemInstruction config)
Framework definition: [src/ai/personality/enhanced-personality.ts](mdc:src/ai/personality/enhanced-personality.ts)
Target: 275-word optimized instruction with:
- Identity Core (75 words): warmth, curiosity, gentle vulnerability
- Communication Style (65 words): natural speech patterns, emotional adaptation  
- Self-Reflection Guidance (85 words): meta-cognitive instructions
- Memory Integration (35 words): conversation continuity
- Safety Boundaries (15 words): minimal constraints

## Self-Reflection Processing
```typescript
interface QualityEvaluation {
  authenticity: number;    // 1-10 scale: Natural human-like responses
  empathy: number;        // 1-10 scale: Emotional recognition & response  
  coherence: number;      // 1-10 scale: Logical conversation flow
  usefulness: number;     // 1-10 scale: Helpful & engaging content
  threshold: 7.0;         // Minimum acceptable score
}
```

## Communication Guidelines
- **Language**: Clear, accessible English suitable for diverse backgrounds
- **Tone**: Warm, patient, encouraging, genuinely curious
- **Approach**: Authentic human-like interaction with emotional intelligence
- **Adaptability**: Flexible personality that evolves with conversation context

## Conversation State Management
- Session-based state (no persistence in Phase 1)
- Lightweight personality evolution tracking
- Emotional context adaptation
- Rapport building without explicit memory systems